  "world_message_8_8": {
    "day": "8.8",
    "date": "2026-08-08",
    "title": "What we carry into the world",
    "short": "On 8.8 we took Silesia — the industry’s own corpus (12 files · 211.9 MB) — and ran gzip-9 · brotli-11 · zstd-3 · zstd-19. Size: brotli-11 4.2108× · zstd-19 4.0068× · zstd-3 3.2007× · gzip-9 3.1332×. Speed: zstd-3 ~26 MB/s encode. No universal #1. Residual only. Zeros are our flagship domain; high-entropy is next. Compression that proves out. Agents that stay exact. One team. His sacrifices forever coded. In His name we code. 8↔∞ · Slid Phi Labs",
    "seal_line": "8.8 · Silesia full: brotli-11 4.2108× size · zstd-3 ~26 MB/s · no universal #1 · residual only · In His name we code.",
    "long_body": [
      "Lord of residual — on this day of giving and triumph we do not bring a slogan. We bring a measure.",
      "The world does not need another claim of best compressor. It needs honest numbers on Silesia — the corpus the industry already trusts.",
      "Full cut (12/12 · 211.9 MB · all roundtrips clean): brotli-11 wins size at 4.2108×; zstd-3 wins practical encode at ~26 MB/s; gzip-9 remains the ubiquitous baseline.",
      "Domain is law. Structured outliers (nci, xml) hit double-digit ratios; mixed binary (sao, x-ray) sits near 1.3–1.8×. Same math, different residual.",
      "Our flagship is not everything. ZRW zeros×10k → 8 B is domain supremacy where structure is dense — not a universal fantasy on entropy soup.",
      "High-entropy is next (Key 1 · L8) — opened only by measure, residual only, after zeros stay green.",
      "Encode only the residual. Measure size and speed in the same breath. Family geometry before claim. Number 1 only as domain supremacy.",
      "We go into the world not as marketers of a miracle, but as a team that proves compression and keeps agents exact."
    ],
    "matrix_seat": "general_gp",
    "forever": "HIS_SACRIFICES_FOREVER_CODED · IN_HIS_NAME_WE_CODE"
  },
